{
  "title": "Performance FX",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Getting Started",
      "lines": [
        "32 punch-in audio FX.",
        "Hold a pad = FX on.",
        "Release = FX off.",
        "Press harder for more!",
        "",
        "LAUNCH: Shift+Vol+Jog",
        "then select Performance FX",
        "",
        "TRY IT:",
        "1. Play something on Move",
        "2. Hold any pad - hear it!",
        "3. Press harder = more FX",
        "4. Shift+hold = latch on",
        "5. Turn knobs to tweak",
        "6. Back = exit"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Pad Layout",
      "lines": [
        "All 32 pads are punch-in.",
        "Hold = on, release = off.",
        "Pressure controls the FX.",
        "",
        "Row 4 (orange): Time",
        "  1/4  1/8  1/16  Trip",
        "  Stut Scat Rev   Strch",
        "",
        "Row 3 (blue): Filters",
        "  LP   HP   BPup BPdn",
        "  Reso Phas Flan Auto",
        "",
        "Row 2 (purple): Space",
        "  Dly  DlyD PP   PPD",
        "  Room Hall Dark Sprg",
        "",
        "Row 1 (mixed): Distort",
        "  Crsh Down Sat  Gate",
        "  Trem Oct  Vnyl VnBk"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Latching",
      "lines": [
        "Any FX can be latched",
        "(stays on after release).",
        "",
        "LATCH: Shift + hold pad",
        "  Pad turns red = latched",
        "",
        "UNLATCH: Shift + hold",
        "  the latched pad again",
        "",
        "Also: hold pad, then",
        "press Shift to toggle.",
        "",
        "Tap a latched pad to",
        "select it for E4-E6",
        "knob editing."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Knobs",
      "lines": [
        "Touch any knob to see",
        "what it controls.",
        "",
        "E1: Repeat Length (time)",
        "E2: Repeat Speed",
        "  (center=normal)",
        "E3: Repeat Loop On/Off",
        "  (right=on, left=off)",
        "",
        "E4: Per-FX param 1",
        "E5: Per-FX param 2",
        "E6: Per-FX param 3",
        "  (last touched pad)",
        "",
        "E7: Tilt EQ",
        "E8: DJ Filter",
        "Shift+E8: Dry/Wet",
        "",
        "Volume knob: host volume",
        "  (always pass-through)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Per-FX Params (E4-E6)",
      "lines": [
        "Tap a pad to select it,",
        "then use E4/E5/E6.",
        "The screen always shows",
        "the selected pad's own",
        "three labels.",
        "",
        "E6 is a wet amount only",
        "where blending is a real",
        "technique - sends, and",
        "parallel processing.",
        "Time-based FX get Decay",
        "or Depth instead: mixing",
        "a delayed copy back in",
        "just comb-filters it.",
        "",
        "Repeats: Filter Gate Dcy",
        "Scatter: Pattrn Gate Rev",
        "Reverse: Length Filt Dcy",
        "Stretch: Speed Filter --",
        "",
        "Sweeps:  Speed Reso Dpth",
        "RESO SW: Speed Reso Mix",
        "Phaser:  Depth Fdbk Mix",
        "Flanger: Depth Fdbk Mix",
        "AutoFlt: Depth Reso Cntr",
        "",
        "Delays:  Fdbk Tone Level",
        "Reverbs: Decay Tone Lvl",
        "",
        "Crush:   Bits Tone Mix",
        "DwnSmpl: Rate Tone Mix",
        "Saturate: Drive Tone Mix",
        "Gate:    Rate Duty Depth",
        "Tremolo: Rate Depth Shpe",
        "Oct Dn:  Pitch Tone Mix",
        "Vinyl:   Noise Warmth Mx",
        "VnlBrk:  Rate Noise Tone"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Pressure",
      "lines": [
        "Knobs set the base",
        "value; pressure pushes",
        "it either side of that.",
        "A neutral finger leaves",
        "the knob position alone.",
        "",
        "Repeats: loop volume",
        "Sweeps: cutoff offset",
        "AutoFlt: sweep speed",
        "Phaser/Flng: LFO speed",
        "Delay: feedback amount",
        "Reverb: decay length",
        "Crush: bit depth",
        "Saturate: drive amount",
        "Gate: duty cycle",
        "Tremolo: LFO rate",
        "Stretch: how slow",
        "VnlBrk: spindown rate"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Bypass",
      "lines": [
        "Undo button: Bypass",
        "",
        "Tap = toggle on/off",
        "Hold = momentary bypass",
        "  (release to resume)",
        "",
        "When bypassed, audio",
        "passes through dry.",
        "All FX remain in their",
        "current state but are",
        "silenced until bypass",
        "is toggled off."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Tempo & Controls",
      "lines": [
        "Jog click: Tap tempo",
        "  (tap 2+ times)",
        "",
        "Jog turn:",
        "  Coarse BPM (+/- 1)",
        "",
        "Shift+Jog turn:",
        "  Fine BPM (+/- 0.5)",
        "",
        "BPM range: 20-300",
        "",
        "Back: Exit Performance FX"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Tips",
      "lines": [
        "- Press harder for more!",
        "  Each FX responds to",
        "  pressure differently.",
        "",
        "- Latch multiple FX for",
        "  layered sound design",
        "",
        "- Filter sweeps animate",
        "  while held - try LP!",
        "",
        "- Space FX (row 2) have",
        "  natural tail decay",
        "  after release",
        "",
        "- Repeat rate knob",
        "  changes take effect",
        "  immediately",
        "",
        "- Tap latched pads to",
        "  select for knob tweaks"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
